tion":{"commit_sha":"f990a1a5a56694c9df14172c5c3cb134b36e2628","position":"1785020427673877001-6aa33107-6984-4879-8c45-d00b04996b5c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ed200b5bcebee95acf6693a1c314b1996fc9a0a09e4512187d57ab7ac7652a24","event_uuid":"f26b95ef-5dae-47f6-930e-c49ed97bb69e","position":{"commit_sha":"f990a1a5a56694c9df14172c5c3cb134b36e2628","position":"1785020428018261001-f26b95ef-5dae-47f6-930e-c49ed97bb69e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"bc0b8e743c4e03c627071ec0e98284d0e786036ac134a1623a559bb24eef6b0b","event_uuid":"d19b3c13-ce7e-461e-a4e9-8f4adf5581e6","position":{"commit_sha":"06ac4370c5f61fbaebc90541aa18879892e86de5","position":"1785020534898469001-d19b3c13-ce7e-461e-a4e9-8f4adf5581e6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Fresh plan review BLOCKed on a valid G6 mismatch: the old text implied project criteria entered both round_a and round_b. Remediated to the landed contract: project LLM criteria fan into round_a exactly once and are never injected into round_b, whose bounded membership remains escalation/overlay-controlled. Strengthened markers with round_b and project.; clarified one-gate eval resolution and located config errors. Portability advisory deferred because the repository’s canonical Codex verification commands intentionally use this worktree’s POSIX .venv/bin/python path.","timestamp":1785019932142198001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Fresh re-review PASS with zero blockers. Advisory disposition: adopt exact semantic phrase checks for 'exactly once' and 'not injected into round_b' in execution evidence; audit nearby existing four-pass prose for contradictions before writing. Defer P6 splitting because the three ACs already isolate headings, section markers, and Round-A/B accuracy as separate observable outcomes. No scope expansion.","timestamp":1785020422725897001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Documentation implementation complete: added the normative four-subheading section after the four-pass example. Pre-edit audit found no existing project-criterion/effective-routing prose to contradict. Heading AC PASS; marker AC PASS including round_a, round_b, project., logical criterion id, effective routing, criteria eval, configuration error, exactly once, and not injected. Diff check clean; scope is docs/llm-framework.md only. Starting canonical gates.","timestamp":1785020534898469001}],"created_at":1784670028438978001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5d1346f9-09b0-4355-b297-9a649d713157","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"41e2-a0a2-2db4-4847"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nThe completed project code-review seam is now implemented across fan-in, Pass-3 routing, eval resolution, and CLI admission, but `docs/llm-framework.md` does not state the resulting runtime contract. Without one authoritative description, later changes can silently misstate or regress how repository-owned code-review criteria enter and flow through the four-pass gate. This documentation story depends on the surface-completing CLI child `[rebar:41e2-a0a2-2db4-4847]`, which is closed and landed.\n\n## Approach\n\nAdd a normative `Code-review project criteria` section to `docs/llm-framework.md`. Give each aspect its own `####` subheading and document the exact landed behavior:\n\n1. `#### Round A/B fan-in` — repository-effective project LLM criteria are injected exactly once into `round_a`; they are not injected into `round_b`, whose membership remains controlled by the bounded escalation/overlay selection. Each project finding retains its logical criterion id in the `project.<name>` namespace.\n2. `#### Effective routing in Pass 3` — the repository-scoped effective routing map governs deterministic threshold, blocking, advisory, and nit-suppression decisions for the logical project id.\n3. `#### criteria eval resolution` — a project code-review id active in exactly one gate resolves and calibrates through the code-review arm of `criteria eval`; unknown and cross-gate-ambiguous ids are rejected before calibration.\n4. `#### Configuration error` — an activated project criterion with a missing or invalid prompt/eval specification raises a located configuration error rather than silently falling back.\n\n**Rejected alternative.** A separate new document would fragment the four-pass contract, which already has its authoritative home in `docs/llm-framework.md`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `docs/llm-framework.md` — add the normative section and four aspect subheadings only.\n\nNo production behavior changes. Verification is a deterministic documentation-content check against the required headings and contract markers.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `docs/llm-framework.md` gains a `Code-review project criteria` section with four distinct subheadings: `#### Round A/B fan-in`, `#### Effective routing in Pass 3`, `#### criteria eval resolution`, and `#### Configuration error`; verified by `rtk .venv/bin/python -c \"from pathlib import Path; s=Path('docs/llm-framework.md').read_text(); heads=['#### Round A/B fan-in','#### Effective routing in Pass 3','#### criteria eval resolution','#### Configuration error']; missing=[h for h in heads if h not in s]; assert not missing, missing\"`.\n- [ ] The section body states the exact runtime contract, including the markers `round_a`, `round_b`, `project.`, `logical criterion id`, `effective routing`, `criteria eval`, and `configuration error`; verified by `rtk .venv/bin/python -c \"from pathlib import Path; s=Path('docs/llm-framework.md').read_text(); sec=s.split('Code-review project criteria',1)[1][:5000]; markers=['round_a','round_b','project.','logical criterion id','effective routing','criteria eval','configuration error']; missing=[m for m in markers if m not in sec]; assert not missing, missing\"`.\n- [ ] The Round A/B subsection explicitly says project criteria run exactly once in `round_a` and are not injected into `round_b`, matching `CodeReviewBatchRunner`; verified by manual comparison with `src/rebar/llm/code_review/batch_runner.py` plus the marker command above.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/llm-framework.md","reason":"Add Code-review project criteria contract section"}],"keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["depends_on","41e2-a0a2-2db4-4847"],["parent","119f-63e3-34b7-4f96"]],"parent_id":"119f-63e3-34b7-4f96","parent_status_uuid":"6aa33107-6984-4879-8c45-d00b04996b5c","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["review-architecture","project-criteria","integration"],"ticket_id":"19dd-7d89-972b-4274","ticket_type":"story","title":"Document the code-review project-criterion runtime contract","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5a179993-06c7-4105-a4ed-9d88ae3ebc80","b591fd77-e78f-409b-8736-4dc859ac75f0","5d1346f9-09b0-4355-b297-9a649d713157","56a14082-5e99-4539-a084-4fda23e2d71f","efd94b5f-0af2-4685-bae8-628f58708e9a","f1c8a58c-b54b-435b-8618-6dbe61af48ed","c0b9f3ee-ed0e-4451-9859-3934dfe369c7","f84e0cc6-9059-49f9-b7ac-ab5267642887","5b285200-a196-4b59-9c56-b11ce93df2a8","fe8ab285-e27d-4c2d-bd6a-939373f4596c","95d0d050-d390-42f6-8e91-f8cca59093e1","6aa33107-6984-4879-8c45-d00b04996b5c","f26b95ef-5dae-47f6-930e-c49ed97bb69e","d19b3c13-ce7e-461e-a4e9-8f4adf5581e6"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785020534898469002,"uuid":"5d1b0859-f12c-48eb-b11f-b64e07538144"}